  "text": "Intake note (Commercial team, 30 July 2024). Our client Madhuri Rane is a 26-year-old textile trader who lives at Bungalow 4, Lajpat Nagar, New Delhi 110019 and can be reached on 06385849901 or madhuri.rane@example.com. The client's PAN XYJPR4477H.\nThe client consulted us about a cheque bounce matter against M/s Skyline Traders. A cheque for ₹9,85,000 issued by Skyline Traders bounced: the drawer stopped the cheque with a stop-payment instruction.\nThe cheque was deposited in the client's account no. 470179897272 (IFSC HDFC0781908).\nThe matter was filed as CC/672/2024 before the Judicial Magistrate First Class Court at New Delhi on 10 September 2024.",
